Description:
Shauna is a main OC from a friend of mine (Ptls), there's also a "Tv Tokyo" like channel that overwrites the Fortune Teller channel for 1 week , with anime episodes.
<br />* The Mod includes many dialogues for the new character Shauna and dialogues for the vanilla characters on the game;
<br />* She has one cloth for each season as well as one for the desert, beach (ginger island) and pajamas;
<br />* 5 heart events and appearances in the towns festivals. She is marriageable but i never merried her so, if there is any bugs on that, my bad;
<br />* No custom spouse room yet;
<br />* There may be some unexpected behavior/bugs, i'll be working on them going ahead; B)
